<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48730" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θηρ-ευτής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οῦ</span>,
			ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hunter</i>, used by <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> (only in <i><span class="en">
				Il.
			</span></i>) always as Adj., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύνεσσι
				καὶ ἀνδράσι θηρευτῇσιν</span> hounds and
			<i>huntsmen</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				12.41
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν κυσὶ θηρευτῇσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11.325
				</span></i>
			; so 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θ. ἄνδρες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Sc.</u>
					303
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				388
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύνες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thgn.
					1254
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Ages.</u>
				9.6
			</span></i>: as Subst., <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.123
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Satyr.
				<u>Vit.Eur.Fr.</u>
				39
			</span></i> XX<i><span class="en">
				i14
			</span></i>; of <i>a fisher</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.70
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θ. πέρδιξ</span>
			<i>a decoy</i> partridge, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				614a10
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θ. ἰξός</span>”
				<i>birdlime,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					AP
					5.99
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θ. νέων καὶ πλουσίων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Sph.</u>
					231d
				</span></i>
			, cf. Chor.<i><span class="en">
				p.67
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				B.
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καλλίστων ὀνομάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ath.
					3.122c
				</span></i>
			.</div>
